      "widgets_values": [
        "KREA 2 ReID - OFFICIAL SETTINGS\n\n1. Install ostris/ComfyUI-Krea2-Ostris-Edit.\n2. Load one prepared face/head-and-shoulders reference.\n3. Use Comfy-Org's Krea 2 Turbo INT8 ConvRot model.\n4. Keep LoRA strength at 1.0 and kv_cache ON.\n5. Keep 8 steps, CFG 1.0, Euler/simple for the tested path.\n6. Output size is independent from the reference."
      ],
      "color": "#243447",
      "bgcolor": "#34506b"
    },
