      "widgets_values": [
        "REFERENCE REMINDER\n\nThis graph scales the prepared reference to the released 384x384 total-pixel budget. Crop around the face, hair, and some upper body first for maximum outfit/pose freedom. A full-body reference can intentionally carry over clothing and pose."
